#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Queres que che diga todas as opcións?"
msgstr "Do you want me to tell you all the options?"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Vai levar [shake rate=20 level=10]tempo[/shake]..."
msgstr "It will take [shake rate=20 level=10]time[/shake]..."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "si"
msgstr "yes"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Que peñazo"
msgstr "What a drag"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "non"
msgstr "no"

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Estas son todas as opcións que che podo contar."
msgstr "These are all the options I can tell you."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Primeiro, podes mirar a planta con calma."
msgstr "First, you can look at the plant calmly."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Despois, podes volver falar comigo cando queiras."
msgstr "Afterward, you can talk to me again whenever you want."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Vale, entendo. Vou mirar con calma."
msgstr "Okay, I understand. I'll take a careful look."

#: dialogues/example.dialogue
msgid "Perfecto. Se atopas algo raro, volve e cóntamo."
msgstr "Perfect. If you find something strange, come back and tell me."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esqueciches as herbiñas ou é que che sobra o tempo?"
msgstr "Did you forget the little herbs, or do you just have time to spare?"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esta Mundo xa non rexe. Faltoulle o tomiño,"
msgstr "This Mundo’s gone off the rails. She forgot to mention the thyme,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "a menta, a ruda, e mais a macela."
msgstr "mint, rue, and chamomile."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "E tamén o sabugueiro e a herba da Nosa Señora…"
msgstr "And also elder and mugwort..."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "E mira de levar silveira, pero ollo con prender nela!"
msgstr ""
"And make sure to bring bramble, but be careful not to get snagged on it!"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Esquecín, si"
msgstr "I forgot, yes"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Non"
msgstr "No"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Fiúncho, fento macho, herba luísa, xesta, romeu,"
msgstr "Fennel, male fern, lemon verbena, broom, rosemary,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "malva, herba de San Xoán…"
msgstr "mallow, St. John's wort..."

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "Se queres collelas todas, bule, paxarín,"
msgstr "If you want to gather them all, hurry up, little bird,"

#: dialogues/scene1/oldwoman.dialogue
msgid "que o [shake rate=20 level=5]tempo[/shake] voa como voa o vento!."
msgstr ""
"because [shake rate=20 level=5]time[/shake] flies just like the wind does!."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Conseguiches {plant_name}!"
msgstr "You got {plant_name}!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Se arraiar, se arraiará"
msgstr "If dawn breaks, break it will,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "tódalas meigas levará;"
msgstr "sweep the witches off the hill;"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "xa arraiou, xa arraiou,"
msgstr "dawn has broke, dawn has broke,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "tódalas meigas levou."
msgstr "swept the witches up like smoke."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Por ser noite de San Xoán"
msgstr "Cause tonight's Saint John's Eve"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "noite de encantos e bruxas"
msgstr "night of spells and witches' howl"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "por ser noite de San Xoán"
msgstr "'cause tonight's Saint John's Eve"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "non teño medo, curuxa!"
msgstr "I'm not scared of you, old owl!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Vinte unha crara noite,"
msgstr "I saw you one clear evening,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "noitiña de San Xoán,"
msgstr "on Saint John's Eve by moonlight,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "poñendo as frescas herbas"
msgstr "placing the fresh-cut herbs"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "na fonte a serenar."
msgstr "in the fountain overnight."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Amigue, irei ó San Xoán,"
msgstr "Friend, I'm going to Saint John's"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "queira ou non quera meu pai!"
msgstr "whether my dad likes it or not!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Agárdame na verbena"
msgstr "Wait for me at the verbena"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "- enriba, na calle Maior-,"
msgstr "on Main Street - that's the spot -,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Si non chego pola noite,"
msgstr "If I don't get there before midnight,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "hei de chegar polo albor."
msgstr "I'll be there come morning light!"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Herbiñas de San Xoán\n"
"Grandes poderes nos traerán"
msgstr ""
"Little herbs of Saint John's Day\n,"
"great powers you will bring our way,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Auga roseira, flor de verán,\n"
"todos os males afastarán."
msgstr ""
"rosewater, summer's sweet bouquet,\n"
"all evil you will drive away."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Co seu esconxuro de grande ocultismo\n"
"mandarán para o lume o capitalismo."
msgstr ""
"With their grand old occultism,\n"
"they'll cast into the fire: capitalism."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Mala herba, onde medre,\n"
"non hai xiada que a leve."
msgstr ""
"Bad weed, wherever it may grow,\n"
"no killing frost can lay it low."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Mal agoiro, cando prenda,\n"
"non hai ensalmo que o fenda."
msgstr ""
"Bad omen, once it takes its hold,\n"
"no spell can break it, truth be told."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Ovella e abella\n"
"e pedra que trebella"
msgstr ""
"Sheep bell and honey spell,\n"
"the rolling stone that stumbled, fell,"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"e péndola tras da orella.\n"
"Lembra, para a vindeira,\n"
"o que dicía a vella:"
msgstr ""
"a feather tucked where whispers dwell.\n"
"Remember, for the next round - well,\n"
"what the old woman used to tell:"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"“Se a cobiza fose sol,\n"
"a ninguén daría calor”."
msgstr ""
"“If greed were ever sun,\n"
"it would warm no one.”"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Non envexes a quen ten\n"
"herbas e flores dos montes"
msgstr ""
"Don't envy those who have\n"
"herbs and flowers from the mountains."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Só envexa a quen bebe\n"
"auga de todas as fontes.”"
msgstr ""
"Only envy those who drink\n"
"water from all the fountains."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Nin herba nin pétalo, espiña nin póla\n"
"Deixaches ir todo nesta noite tola."
msgstr ""
"Neither herb nor petal, thorn nor branch in sight,\n"
"you let it all slip by on this one midsummer night."

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"Corta a rosa, paxaro, cando a flor aínda é nova\n"
"e lembra que a idade murcha igual que a folla"
msgstr ""
"Cut the rose, little bird, while the bloom has yet to unfold,\n"
"and remember: age will wilt you as the year grows cold."


#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Cacho mediocre"
msgstr "Mediocre bouquet"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid ""
"A mal mortal ningunha menciña lle val.\n"
"Morte por morte! En ti caeu hoxe a sorte…"
msgstr ""
"For mortal ill, no cure at all.\n"
"Death for death! Today fate made its call…"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "Por San Xoán, pedras ao can, bólas ao chan, fouce na man:"
msgstr "Saint John's Day: stone at the hound, balls to the ground, scythe turning round:"

#: dialogues/info.dialogue
msgid "malas herbas que xa non están outras mellores traerán."
msgstr "bad weeds no longer abound, better ones are sure to be found."

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "Nunca estouraches o estalo?"
msgstr "Have you never popped the popper?"

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "Proba a cortalo e bótallo ao cacho:"
msgstr "Try cutting it and add it to the bouquet:"

#: dialogues/scene1/tutorial.dialogue
msgid "preme cando o punto de corte estea no verde claro"
msgstr "press when the marker is in the light green zone"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Ao alumnado dos cursos que corresponda:"
msgstr "To the students of the relevant courses:"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Materia: Ciencias da Terra e Botánica."
msgstr "Subject: Earth Sciences and Botany."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Contidos:"
msgstr "Contents:"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "- Endemismos e plantas en perigo de extinción no"
msgstr "- Endemic species and endangered plants in the"

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "barrio de Duasaugas: detección e coidados in situ."
msgstr "Duasaugas neighborhood: detection and in situ care."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "- Especies invasoras: como recoñecelas, cortalas e desbotalas."
msgstr "- Invasive species: how to identify, cut, and remove them."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Prácticum: Herbario de San Xoán. As herbas \"máxicas\" de Duasaugas."
msgstr "Practicum: Saint John's Herbarium. The \"magical\" herbs of Duasaugas."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Exame: 7 de setembro, aula 7G."
msgstr "Exam: September 7th, classroom 7G."

#: dialogues/scene1/school_board.dialogue
msgid "Data límite de entrega: 7 de setembro"
msgstr "Submission deadline: September 7th"

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"É a mañá do 23 de xuño, véspera de San Xoán, a data que marca no calendario "
"o final do curso escolar e o solsticio de verán."
msgstr ""
"It is the morning of June 23, Saint John's Eve, the date that marks on the "
"calendar the end of the school year and the summer solstice."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"A xente de Dúasaugas prepárase para celebrar o Lumenovo, noite de culto, de "
"festa e de ritos de cambio de ciclo que se perden atrás na memoria."
msgstr ""
"The people of Dúasaugas are getting ready to celebrate Lumenovo, a night of "
"worship, festivity, and cycle-changing rituals lost in the mists of memory."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"Mais a vella Mundo, unha das veciñas máis lonxevas do barrio, lembra aínda o "
"nome das plantas que noutro tempo se usaban para curar feridas, espantar os "
"demos e protexer de meigas o berce, a casa e as cortes."
msgstr ""
"But old Mundo, one of the neighborhood's longest-lived residents, still "
"remembers the names of the plants that were once used to heal wounds, drive "
"away demons, and protect the cradle, the home, and the stables from witches."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid ""
"Os males de hoxe non son os que eran pero as Herbas de San Xoán aínda "
"funcionan como ritual de protección e purificación a calquera que crea nelas."
msgstr ""
"Today's evils are not what they used to be, but the Herbs of Saint John "
"still work as a ritual of protection and purification for anyone who "
"believes in them."

#: dialogues/intro.dialogue
msgid "Cada unha co seu poder. Búscaas para escorrentar os malos espíritos…"
msgstr ""
"Each one has its own power. Seek them out to drive away evil spirits..."

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "Aromáticas e medicinais plantadas pola"
msgstr "Aromatic and medicinal plants grown by the"

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "comunidade do parque de Duasaugas."
msgstr "community of Duasaugas park."

#: dialogues/scene2/terrace_poster.dialogue
msgid "Cortar con tino. Non asulagar. Deixar para quen vén detrás."
msgstr "Cut with care. Do not overwater. Leave some for those who come after."

#: scripts/minigames/cutting_minigame.gd:76
msgid "Ben!"
msgstr "Great!"

#: scripts/minigames/cutting_minigame.gd:84
msgid "Fallaches"
msgstr "Miss!"

#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "Sálvame, lume de San Xoán,"
msgstr "Save me, Saint John's bonfire flame,"

#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "para que non me trabe caseiro nin can"
msgstr "let no man nor dog me tame,"

#: dialogues/scene1/firelight.dialogue
msgid "nin cantos males han…"
msgstr "nor whatever evils came…"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid "Uuuuuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaaaah….. Iiiiiiuuuuuuh……. Aaaaaaaaah…."
msgstr "Uuuuuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaaaah….. Iiiiiiuuuuuuh……. Aaaaaaaaah…."

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Iraaaaás ao abrente do dííía\n"
"a aaauga freeesca cataaaaaar"
msgstr ""
"Gooooo and feeeetch the freeeesh coool waaaater\n"
"at the breeeeak of daaaay"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"da aaaaauga do paxariiiiño\n"
"que saúúde che haaa de daaaar."
msgstr ""
"frooom the liiittle biiiirdie's spring\n"
"that heeeealth will seeeend your waaaaay."

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Coooooorre, criatura,\n"
"vaaaite lavaaaaar"
msgstr ""
"Ruuuuuun nooooow, liiiittle ooooone,\n"
"gooo waaaash the niiight awaaaaay"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"alááá na foooooonte\n"
"te haaaaaas de lavaaar,"
msgstr ""
"oooover at the foooountain\n"
"wheeeere the coool waaaaters plaaaay,"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"e a freeeeeesca aaaaauga\n"
"deeeesta amañeciiiiida"
msgstr ""
"aaaaand the freeeesh coool waaaaters\n"
"oooof thiiis beeeautiful daaaawn"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"cooooooor da cereixa\n"
"che teeeen que daaaaar."
msgstr ""
"cheeerrrry reeeed and roooosy\n"
"will coooome to yooooou todaaaay"

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid "Uuuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaah….. Uuuuuuh……. Ooooaaaaah…."
msgstr "Uuuuuuh….. Aaaaaaah….. Uuuuuuh……. Ooooaaaaah…."

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"Nin apio, nin fiuncho nin pirixel.\n"
"Se atopas nabo de San Pedro\n"
"escapa del."
msgstr ""
"No celery, no fennel, no parsley – none!\n"
"If Saint Peter's turnip comes along,\n"
"you'd better run."

#: dialogues/scene2/wind_and_font.dialogue
msgid ""
"E, lembra, hoxe como sempre foi:\n"
"Vale máis a pegada de cen mosquitos\n"
"que pé de boi."
msgstr ""
"And remember, as it's always been:\n"
"A hundred mosquito stingers\n"
"beat dead man's fingers."

